# MUST NOT BE DISCOVERED.
#
# The scan skips every directory whose name starts with `.`, which is the rule
# that keeps `.git` out. This fixture is `.hidden/` and not `.git/` for a dull
# reason: git refuses to track any path with a `.git` component, so a committed
# `.git/hidden.rules` is not a thing that can exist. The `.git` case itself is
# built at test time in `tests/rules_security.rs`.

fields date, description, amount
account1 assets:decoy:hidden
